  "openWorldHint": false,
  "readOnlyHint": true,
  "title": "Get one product in full"
 },
 "description": "Everything public about one product, by its slug from find_products or search_findabis: dose form and strength, strain and brand, terpenes, what it contains (carrier oil, allergens, capsule shell), dosage and storage notes, patient leaflets and FAQs, and its price range across UK pharmacies when Findabis publishes one. Not returned: stock, pack sizes on offer, and which pharmacies dispense it at what price \u2014 the product page shows those only to patients and professionals with access. It describes the product, never who should take it.",
 "execution": {
  "taskSupport": "forbidden"
 },
